<!-- ================================================================ SHIFT -->
<section class="band" id="shift" aria-labelledby="shift-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">01 · Why now</span>
      <h2 id="shift-heading">Interfaces are moving from pages to <span class="accent">runtime output.</span></h2>
      <p>When an AI generates the UI at runtime, the web's security assumptions break.
        The interface is no longer authored, reviewed, or trusted — it's emitted.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="chips reveal">
      <div class="chip">
        <div class="glyph">[▤ ●●●●●]</div>
        <h3>Hallucinated phishing</h3>
        <p>A generated form can ask for a password that was never supposed to exist.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chip">
        <div class="glyph">&lt;script&gt;⌁&lt;/script&gt;</div>
        <h3>Injection as UI</h3>
        <p>Prompt injection stops being text and becomes an interface the user acts on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="chip">
        <div class="glyph">? ? ?</div>
        <h3>No proof of what was shown</h3>
        <p>Nothing records the exact frame a human actually saw and decided on.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ================================================================ HOW -->
<section class="band" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">02 · How it works</span>
      <h2 id="how-heading">Every frame passes the gate — <span class="accent">fail-closed.</span></h2>
      <p>The path from an agent's intent to a human's decision, recorded end to end.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pipe reveal">
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">01 · EMIT</div>
        <h3>Agent emits a frame</h3>
        <p>Declarative JSON over a safe component vocabulary — never raw model HTML or JS.</p>
        <pre>frame &#123;
  card,
  <span class="p">button</span>: approve
&#125;</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">02 · VALIDATE</div>
        <h3>Policy validates it</h3>
        <p>Checked against declarative policy. Unsafe shapes are blocked before render.</p>
        <pre><span class="o">✓</span> vocabulary ok
<span class="o">✓</span> no secrets
<span class="x">✕</span> block on fail</pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">03 · RECORD</div>
        <h3>Audit chain records it</h3>
        <p>The exact frame + verdict is written to a tamper-evident, hash-chained log.</p>
        <pre><span class="p">sha256</span>:1a2f9c…
prev←<span class="p">e07b</span></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="step">
        <div class="num">04 · DECIDE</div>
        <h3>Human decides, durably</h3>
        <p>The decision loop is event-sourced — it survives crashes, restarts, and time.</p>
        <pre>await <span class="o">decision</span>
resume ✓</pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

