    <div class="grid8 reveal">
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Agent Runtime</div><p>The model→tool→model loop with context management and step budgets.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Workflow Engine</div><p>Durable, event-sourced DAGs that resume exactly where they crashed.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Tool Runtime</div><p>Sandboxed execution — native, container, gVisor, microVM — fail-closed.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Memory Engine</div><p>Hybrid vector + keyword retrieval with recency and importance ranking.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">LLM Gateway</div><p>OpenAI, Anthropic, or a local model — with failover, caching, breakers.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Plugin Framework</div><p>Signed, sandboxed WASM extensions with a governed marketplace.</p></div>
      <div class="cap"><div class="t">Workflow Studio</div><p>A dashboard to compose, run, and monitor agents and workflows.</p></div>
